      "cooked": "<p>I had an interesting thing come up in a game yesterday.&nbsp; I was playing Wraith and the villain was Iron Legacy.&nbsp; I had Combat Stance in play and Iron Legacy had Demoralizing Presence.&nbsp; If Demoralizing Presence forces Wraith to deal damage to herself, does Combat Stance now make Wraith Deal damage to herself?</p>",
