    {
      "id": 93439,
      "name": "JimmytheRat",
      "username": "JimmytheRat",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-03T22:51:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We have a houserule that targets that have some sort of retaliation won't hit themselves with it.&nbsp; Gauntlets of Perdition will still activate, but Backlash Field, Flame Barrier, Combat Stance, the Chairman, etc. don't.</p><p>Not strictly official, but it makes a lot more sense than Wraith punching herself in the gut every round because she's got the Sewer Flu.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:19:39.811Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
