      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>You can come up with thematic explanations for it.&nbsp; Combat Stance is about Wraith having trained herself to be extraordinarily alert---but when she&#39;s infected, she&#39;s weakened, so maybe staying that vigilant actually puts an extra strain on her body.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For Flame Barrier, maybe when Ra&#39;s infected he starts having trouble controlling the fire around him.&nbsp; He&#39;s keeping that barrier up all the time, but when the infection kicks in he gets dizzy, loses his focus, and burns himself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You&#39;ve gotta go a little bit afield from what the effects are normally signifying, but I think you can still keep things interesting and flavorful.</p>",
